flowchart TD
    START([fa:fa-gauge-high Performance Issue Reported]) --> BASELINE{Check Baselines}

    BASELINE -->|P99 > 500ms| LATENCY[fa:fa-clock High Latency]
    BASELINE -->|CPU > 90%| CPU[fa:fa-microchip High CPU]
    BASELINE -->|Memory > 95%| MEMORY[fa:fa-memory Memory Exhaustion]
    BASELINE -->|Error rate > 5%| ERRORS[fa:fa-circle-exclamation Error Spike]
    BASELINE -->|DB query > 1s| DBSLOW[fa:fa-database Slow Queries]

    LATENCY --> PROFILE_CPU[CPU Profile<br/>pprof/profile 30s]
    LATENCY --> CHECK_DB[Check pg_stat_statements<br/>slow query log]

    CPU --> PROFILE_CPU
    CPU --> GOROUTINE[Check goroutine count<br/>pprof/goroutine]

    MEMORY --> HEAP[Heap Profile<br/>pprof/heap]
    MEMORY --> BATCH[Review batch sizes<br/>Check slice growth]

    ERRORS --> LOGS[Check error logs<br/>kubectl logs --tail=500]
    ERRORS --> DEPS[Check downstream deps<br/>health endpoints]

    DBSLOW --> EXPLAIN[EXPLAIN ANALYZE<br/>slow queries]
    DBSLOW --> LOCKS[Check pg_locks<br/>for contention]

    PROFILE_CPU --> CPU_DIAG{Root Cause?}
    CPU_DIAG -->|JSON serialization| FIX_JSON[Switch to sonic/jsoniter]
    CPU_DIAG -->|Regex recompilation| FIX_REGEX[Compile once at init]
    CPU_DIAG -->|Hot loop| FIX_ALGO[Optimize algorithm]

    GOROUTINE --> GR_DIAG{Root Cause?}
    GR_DIAG -->|Leak — missing cancel| FIX_CTX[Add context cancellation]
    GR_DIAG -->|Mutex contention| FIX_MUTEX[Reduce lock scope]
    GR_DIAG -->|Channel blocking| FIX_CHAN[Add buffered channel / select]

    HEAP --> MEM_DIAG{Root Cause?}
    MEM_DIAG -->|Unbounded slice| FIX_STREAM[Use streaming / generators]
    MEM_DIAG -->|String concat in loop| FIX_BUILDER[Use strings.Builder]
    MEM_DIAG -->|Reference leak| FIX_REF[Nil stale references]

    EXPLAIN --> DB_DIAG{Root Cause?}
    DB_DIAG -->|Missing index| FIX_INDEX[CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY]
    DB_DIAG -->|Table bloat| FIX_VACUUM[VACUUM ANALYZE]
    DB_DIAG -->|Lock contention| FIX_LOCK[Reduce transaction scope]

    LOCKS --> DB_DIAG
    LOGS --> ERR_DIAG{Root Cause?}
    ERR_DIAG -->|Downstream timeout| FIX_TIMEOUT[Increase timeout / add circuit breaker]
    ERR_DIAG -->|Connection pool full| FIX_POOL[Increase pool / add PgBouncer]
    DEPS --> ERR_DIAG
    BATCH --> MEM_DIAG

    FIX_JSON --> VERIFY
    FIX_REGEX --> VERIFY
    FIX_ALGO --> VERIFY
    FIX_CTX --> VERIFY
    FIX_MUTEX --> VERIFY
    FIX_CHAN --> VERIFY
    FIX_STREAM --> VERIFY
    FIX_BUILDER --> VERIFY
    FIX_REF --> VERIFY
    FIX_INDEX --> VERIFY
    FIX_VACUUM --> VERIFY
    FIX_LOCK --> VERIFY
    FIX_TIMEOUT --> VERIFY
    FIX_POOL --> VERIFY

    VERIFY{fa:fa-check Verify Fix} -->|Baselines met| DONE([fa:fa-circle-check Resolved])
    VERIFY -->|Still degraded| SCALE[Scale horizontally<br/>as interim mitigation]
    SCALE --> START

    style START fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#b45309,color:#fff
    style DONE fill:#22c55e,stroke:#16a34a,color:#fff
    style LATENCY fill:#ef4444,stroke:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style CPU fill:#ef4444,stroke:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style MEMORY fill:#ef4444,stroke:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style ERRORS fill:#ef4444,stroke:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style DBSLOW fill:#ef4444,stroke:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style SCALE fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#b45309,color:#fff
